OL,3,GNEWSAWhy thousands of couples are
OL,4,Achoosing Scotland to say 'I do'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHayden Kuhn and Savannah Aanderud had
OL,7,Fnever set foot in Scotland before they
OL,8,Fdecided it was the perfect place to get
OL,9,Fmarried last May.
OL,11,FThe couple, from Pennsylvania in the
OL,12,FUS, wanted a destination wedding that
OL,13,Fwould take their family and friends on
OL,14,Fan adventure with them.
OL,16,FThey considered locations across
OL,17,FEurope, before deciding on Scotland
OL,18,Fafter Savannah saw photographs of a
OL,19,Fcastle wedding online.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
