OL,3,GNEWSAWhy thousands of couples are
OL,4,Achoosing Scotland to say 'I do'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I think it was on Pinterest," she
OL,7,Fsaid. "Somebody got married in a castle
OL,8,Fand I was like 'Oh, I have to do
OL,9,Fthat'."
